{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-10T12:59:45.637Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"e64a4bf384d39392d902ceda","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5htunt","claim:pm-gh1699","claim:pm-nhauur","lineage:pm-5htunt","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-5htunt+pm-gh1699+pm-nhauur","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-5htunt","claim:pm-gh1699","claim:pm-nhauur","lineage:pm-5htunt","lineage:pm-5oj5","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-10T12:59:45.637Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-10T12:59:45.637Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation (branch fix/credential-shape-coverage): src/core/shared/secret-rules.ts gains a declared SecretStructuredSpelling on password_assignment (keys password|passphrase, element content) and high_entropy_assignment (quoted keys). The flat regexes are now composed from KEY + VALUE constants; a scratch comparison against HEAD confirmed all 20 rule sources and flags are byte-identical, so flat semantics cannot drift. The structured pass judges a quoted key's scalar value and every quoted string in value position inside an array/object under any key spelling, using the rule's own sticky value grammar (so the 8-char minimum and the <, ${, $( placeholder exclusions carry over). Bare tokens inside containers are never judged, which keeps password=[scrubbed] clean. First repo-wide scan found one false positive: tests/fixtures/telemetry/diagnostic-privacy.mjs:47 ('{\"password\": ', safe: true }) because the flat grammar's quoted alternatives cross line breaks; structured values are now bounded to one line (JSON/Python/YAML-flow literals never contain a raw line break). After that, node scripts/check-secrets.mjs is clean over all tracked files. Cost: the structured pass adds about 190 ms to a 196 MB / 24.5 s full-rule scan. The key cursor is cloned per scan because generator yields would otherwise share lastIndex between interleaved scans."}]}],"before_hash":"11504fa12c030cdee949853e8766b5b4251c49fc813b63a5b19f32bc4bfd185b","after_hash":"8d250dfb5ab9dfd9d0897e057670f89d9ff599535c5fcca0567382e4404d4b85","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"bc6fcbb3b831abbdeb4964a1f6c712a58a05602303c2015984e2b6e03a557344"}
